SUMMARY:Feast of Panagia Leiapyrgousaina\, Chalkeios
LOCATION:Chalkeios\, Chios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The country chapel of Panagia Leiapyrgousaina near Chalkeios\, south of Chios town\, keeps the Nativity of the Virgin with festive vespers at 19:00 on the eve and matins\, bread-blessing and liturgy from 07:00 on 8 September. The Nativity is also kept the same day in Pityos\, Lithi\, Elata\, Leptopoda and other villages\; this one is the closest to town.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#chalkeios-feast-of-panagia-leiapyrgousaina-chalkeios
